Thank you to everyone who has donated. I know I haven't been around as
much recently as I should have been, and not as much as I wanted to
be, and I'm sorry for that. The region of Detroit, Michigan is in a
full-blown economic depression. Much of my time, and that of my
Lojban-speaking girlfriend, have been absorbed in job hunting (and
preparing a portfolio site for our new web development business).
Thanks to you, I will get back the use of my phone and car, the lack
of which were getting in the way of job interviews.

This outpouring of support in only fifteen minutes means more than I
can express in any language.

-Eppcott


